r Breed Gift selection lists at character creation, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T18:36:45-07:00","id":1380816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1380798-w20-beast-court-werewolf?p=1380802#post1380802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> anyone in the Courts can use the Court Gift selection lists instead of their Breed Gift selection lists at character creation, yes.</div> </div> </div> </div>My friend insists that his Ahroun can switch Breed (Lupus) and Tribe (Stargazer) gifts for Court Auspice (Fist) Gifts. He wants to have these:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Razor Claws (Tribe gift switched for Court Auspice gift)</li> <li>Resist Pain (Breed gift switched for Court Auspice gift)</li> <li>Rhythm of War (Ahroun gift)</li> </ol>I am of the opinion that Breed and Tribe gifts can only be exchanged for general Hengeyokai gifts, and that Auspice gifts can be exchanged for Court Auspice, as per W20 - Changing Breeds page 284.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <ul><li>Beast Court characters may exchange <b>one of their<br /> starting Gifts (player\u2019s choice)</b> for a General Hengeyokai<br /> Gift.<br /> ...</li> <li>Beast Court characters may exchange <b>one of their<br /> starting Gifts (an Auspice or Aspect Gift, if the character<br /> has such things)</b> for a Gift from his Beast Court<br /> Auspice list.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 04-13-2020, 09:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T19:02:40-07:00","id":1380822,"title":"","content":"Logically, I would say that only the Auspice gift can be swapped for Court Auspice gifts, with the Breed gift - being dependent on the character being born a human or animal and not on allegiance - being unchanged, and the Tribe gift only being exchanged with general non-Auspice Hengeyokai/Court gifts.<br /> <br /> It sounds like he is trying to combat munchkin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}]