be gift only being exchanged with general non-Auspice Hengeyokai/Court gifts.<br /> <br /> It sounds like he is trying to combat munchkin.</div> </div> </div> </div>The breed gift can be exchanged for the general Hengeyokai gifts, any gift can be exchanged for the general list, that is stated.<br /> <br /> And yes, it is a combat munchkin attempt, which I would accept as long as it was valid according the rules, but as far as I can see, it is not (see my quote of the book).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-12T20:28:41-07:00","id":1380842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1380798-w20-beast-court-werewolf?p=1380839#post1380839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah.....yeah thats a Combat-Wombat....what NOoC said. Throw him into a campaign relying on subtlety and negotiation and see how he rolls. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Dont care that he is a minmaxed character, as long as it is following the rules, but it seems that that build can not be done.